line	<str>To unlock the east gate:</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Go into the <col=800000>hellhound</col> room and mine 2 <col=800000>'perfect' gold ore</col>s. Their aggro range is short so try to zigzag through them. Anticipating hits will manageably yield the ores with a rune pickaxe. Alternatively, low level players can stand in a safespot for 10 minutes so the hellhounds stop being aggressive.</col>
