line	<str>Head into the Dwarven Mine underneath Ice Mountain and run to the far most western end and speak to Boot.</str>
line	
line	<str>Teleport to Ardougne, head east and climb down the old ruin entrance to the Witchaven Dungeon near Witchaven and Ardougne ship port. (Labelled on the world map by the File:Dungeon map link icon.png icon. You may need to defend yourself against some hellhounds, so come prepared).</str>
line	
line	<str>Enter the dungeon. Do not enter the wall to the east. There is a north room, a south room, and a locked eastern room that contains hellhounds and the perfect gold ore.</str>
line	
line	<str>To unlock the east gate:</str>
line	
line	<str>Go into the hellhound room and mine 2 'perfect' gold ores. Their aggro range is short so try to zigzag through them. Anticipating hits will manageably yield the ores with a rune pickaxe. Alternatively, low level players can stand in a safespot for 10 minutes so the hellhounds stop being aggressive.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go to a furnace (northern Lumbridge - use the home teleport) and smelt the ores into bars, then use the bars on the furnace again and make one 'perfect' ruby necklace and 'perfect' ruby ring. Be careful not to use make-all as it will make two rings or necklaces</str>
line	
line	<str>Go back to the 'Man' (Avan) and give him the jewellery to receive the second crest piece.</str>
line	
line	<str>Teleport to Varrock (lumberyard teleport), and head north-east to the Jolly Boar Inn near the lumberyard. Go upstairs and speak to Johnathon. Speak to him, and use your anti-poison on him to learn the location of the final crest piece.</str>
line	
line	<str>Prepare for the fight:</str>
line	
line	<str>Go to Edgeville or the small hut west of Varrock if you have a brass key to enter the Edgeville Dungeon.</str>
line	
line	<str>Head to the gate dividing the Wilderness from the rest of the dungeon.</str>
line	
line	<str>Travel slightly north, then make a left past the thugs and Chaos druids, through a second gate.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Travel west, then south past the <col=800000>poison spider</col>s and <col=800000>Black demons</col>, where you will find Chronozon.</col>
