line	
line	<str>Head to Catherby and talk to Caleb in the building north-east of the bank.</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak to him again and give him all the fish. Note: Ask of the whereabouts of the other crest parts, or you will not be able to progress!</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak to the Gem Trader in Al Kharid.</str>
